# Rib width against index and lateral size.
# Reference: the same grid solved with a sparse eigen-solver in SciPy. Bounds: index of the thin slab and of the full slab.
title Silicon rib 400 nm wide on a 90 nm slab
grid dx=0.025 dy=0.01
window width=4.0 ymin=-1.0 ymax=1.22
layer si 0 0.09
rect si -0.2 0.2 0 0.22
symmetry even
field te
expect neff 2.478304080 2e-8
expect group_index 3.841082635 2e-6
expect confinement 0.653428966 1e-6
expect area 0.184021898 1e-5
expect rms_x 0.180419049 1e-6
expect guided yes
expect cells 17760
expect neff_between 2.103273 2.847782
